Package: ofarena
Title: Read Open Foris Arena Survey Data from PostgreSQL
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Alex", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "swburnafterreading2025@gmail.com")
Description: Generic building blocks for apps on top of an Open Foris Arena
    database: connection pool, survey registry and access checks, node
    definitions, reading the flat survey data tables, point geometries from
    Arena coordinate columns, polar offsets (gon) and ray polygons, photo
    retrieval with a disk cache, GeoTIFF overlays served as map tiles, and
    Shiny modules for maps, tables, galleries and record step/cycle filters.
